    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "#Model Development Pipeline\n",
        "#The project will implement a structured NLP pipeline with the following steps:\n",
        "#1.\tTokenization – Break clinical text into words or meaningful chunks using spaCy or scispaCy.\n",
        "#2.\tNamed Entity Recognition (NER) – Identify key diabetes-related concepts such as lab values (HbA1c, glucose), medications (insulin, metformin), and complications (neuropathy, retinopathy).This extracts key diabetes information from messy clinical notes\n",
        "#3.\tRelation Extraction – Link entities together.Instead of random facts we will be able to know who the facts belong to and how it connects\n",
        "#4.\tNormalization – Map extracted entities and relations to standardized medical codes to ensure interoperability across systems.\n",
        "#5.\tSummarization – Generate concise summaries of patient diabetes history, focusing on lab trends, medication changes, and complications. Both rule-based and machine learning approaches will be considered.\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "tEdQ71TpDP_P"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
