            "pt has been seen weekly (often twice weekly) clinic\n",
            "by dr. serial wound debridements and application of\n",
            "foam offloading devices. pt reports worsening pain over the past\n",
            "few days. denies fever or chills. reports that\n",
            "his blood sugars are typically greater than 200.\n",
            ".\n",
            "ros: pt denies cp, sob, cough, nausea, vomitting, fevers\n",
            "\n",
